#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Execute the production camera controller against camera/thread/HAL doubles.

Requests are inspected before explicit simulated CaptureResult delivery. This
checks device requests, real readback precedence, composition and stale cleanup;
it never transforms images or opens a physical camera.
"""
